<title>JAPAN: Hayashikane - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Hayashikane - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 42.50		vs	   41.55</p>
<p> Operating	   85    million	  vs	  580    million</p>
<p> Current     loss 192    million	  vs	prft 263 million</p>
<p> Net	   loss 295    million	  vs	prft 214 million</p>
<p> EPS	     loss 3.31 yen	  vs     prft 2.40 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     89 million	  vs	  89 million</p>
<p> Interim div	    --		vs		--</p>
<p>NOTE - Hayashikane Sangyo Co Ltd is a meat processor.</p>
